{"help": "https://data.vietnam.opendevelopmentmekong.net/api/3/action/help_show?name=package_show", "success": true, "result": {"notes_translated": {"en": "The dataset includes le pourcentage of poor households by region in Vietnam from 1998 to 2016. The standard of poor households for this period based on the average income per person per month of households is updated according to the consumer price index as follows: In 2010, VND 400,000 for rural areas and VND 500,000 for urban areas; Similarly, in 2013 it was VND 570,000 and VND 710,000; in 2014, VND 605,000 dong and VND 750,000; in 2015, there were VND 615,000 and VND 760,000 dong; In 2016, VND 630,000 and VND 780,000 respectively.\r\n", "vi": "B\u1ed9 d\u1eef li\u1ec7u bao g\u1ed3m t\u1ec9 l\u1ec7 ph\u1ea7n tr\u0103m h\u1ed9 ngh\u00e8o theo v\u00f9ng t\u1ea1i Vi\u1ec7t Nam t\u1eeb n\u0103m 1998 t\u1edbi 2016. Chu\u1ea9n ngh\u00e8o trong giai \u0111o\u1ea1n n\u00e0y \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u00ednh theo thu nh\u1eadp b\u00ecnh qu\u00e2n 1 ng\u01b0\u1eddi 1 th\u00e1ng c\u1ee7a h\u1ed9 gia \u0111\u00ecnh \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt theo ch\u1ec9 s\u1ed1 gi\u00e1 ti\u00eau d\u00f9ng nh\u01b0 sau: N\u0103m 2010 l\u00e0 400 ngh\u00ecn \u0111\u1ed3ng \u0111\u1ed1i v\u1edbi khu v\u1ef1c n\u00f4ng th\u00f4n v\u00e0 500 ngh\u00ecn \u0111\u1ed3ng \u0111\u1ed1i v\u1edbi khu v\u1ef1c th\u00e0nh th\u1ecb; t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u1ef1, n\u0103m 2013 l\u00e0 570 ngh\u00ecn \u0111\u1ed3ng v\u00e0 710 ngh\u00ecn \u0111\u1ed3ng; n\u0103m 2014 l\u00e0 605 ngh\u00ecn \u0111\u1ed3ng v\u00e0 750 ngh\u00ecn \u0111\u1ed3ng; n\u0103m 2015 l\u00e0 615 ngh\u00ecn \u0111\u1ed3ng v\u00e0 760 ngh\u00ecn \u0111\u1ed3ng; n\u0103m 2016 l\u00e0 630 ngh\u00ecn \u0111\u1ed3ng v\u00e0 780 ngh\u00ecn \u0111\u1ed3ng. \r\n", "km": "", "th": "", "lo": "", "my": ""}, "MD_Format_version": {"en": "", "vi": "", "km": "", "th": "", "lo": "", "my": ""}, "maintainer": null, "author": null, "CI_Citation_title": {"en": "Proportion of poor households by regi